{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30738","headline":"暮上瞿唐峡 · 项斯","name":"暮上瞿唐峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自古艰难地，孤舟旦暮程。\n独愁空托命，省已是轻生。\n有树皆相倚，无岩不倒倾。\n蛟螭波数怒，鬼怪火潜明。\n履道知无负，离心自要惊。\n何年面骨肉，细话苦辛行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}